{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f82ad4ada296920b035942698886774031667547045798ebb63a63667dbdf361",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:123130de2f1fbd926e997a0d4fe94461a72a571cad85862b86ac772eb1333be4",
      "text": "喂，请问是●●●●プロデューサー吗？\n工作结束了，我现在正准备回事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cad2a094e93defadb36ea51bf9416e6da438b1a71dbced4ddbe7989251ba6d8e",
      "text": "另外，我在车站看到了游乐园的广告。\n万圣节游行，相当受关注呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4db5264bd1d125b2095e55c905cdc3b283f4c197b3ea8244830dae350566ce47",
      "text": "面对正式演出，我已经做好准备了。虽然这种类型的\n工作还是第一次，但我一定会让它成功的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:481380442a2b3e78928e11371cbf37f45c4619476746b7e2e18249ed918b9101",
      "text": "旬先生也要\n乐在其中哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abd6eaa4a0048a68569e72f204ef03d8b388463123d2cf51370882ade4460465",
      "text": "旬先生的话没问题的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2df2f951df2867e406662017c7d2a6b109a27c815e974149a449cc6b23ceb95",
      "text": "……原来如此，确实如此呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b379a5e918d9743a6ef6e5705c09482d667e3baa095ebdb8fd3649c491596ef5",
      "text": "是的。我也这么认为。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c2297213b88f232731c895a958c4bc89bbcc182afd79cf6be8e89e2d1a6f43b",
      "text": "魔术师的角色，我也渐渐找到感觉了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d47c3b82a5de310339cbebd78f1358a681e2b7af4c04219c78b076724b704574",
      "text": "我也好好练习了魔术，敬请期待吧。\n我一定会让观众大吃一惊的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_a:2_4_021_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa4d3fb059640279879f9568573d575fa3c604bb49da430de9138d09bffb0afa",
      "text": "那么，待会儿见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
